/span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为激发学生对机械与能源工程领域的科研热情，搭建师生深度交流、高校学子互助成长的学术平台，助力学子夯实专业基础、拓宽前沿视野，南科大机械与能源工程系现面向全国优秀大学生开放夏季交流营报名，热忱欢迎广大优秀学子踊跃申报！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国高校本科在校生（预计2027年毕业），本科专业要求机械、电子、材料、能源、生物医学、力学、物理等学科方向，对机器人技术、智能制造、成形制造及3D打印、精密超精密加工、软物质设计与制造、激光微纳制造、新能源工程等研究方向及其前沿交叉领域有浓厚的研究兴趣；</span></p><p><span>2. 前三学年本科总评成绩专业排名前30%；</span></p><p><span>3. 对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和良好的英语水平；</span></p><p><span>4. 身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 活动时间：预计</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月上旬</span></strong></span><span>开始</span></p><p><span>2. 活动安排（拟）：拟采用线上线下结合方式，内容包括：开营仪式、院系介绍、学长学姐分享、课题组师生交流、实验室参观、校园全景游览等。</span></p><p><span>3. 活动费用：南科大机能系将为异地学校营员交流营期间在深圳的住宿费及来程路费给予一定额度报销补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿。（线下活动以课题组为单位邀请进行交流，具体报销规定请以各课题组为准。）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式及提交材料</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名时间：</span><span><strong><span>即日起- 6月22日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2.报名方式：申请人登陆南科大交流营网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。网址：https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）需填报不超过3个意向交流导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上所标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p><p><span>（7）个人简历（一页，中英文不限）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>我系导师及研究方向见系官网：https://mee.sustech.edu.cn/quanzhijiaoshi/。点击文末“阅读原文”跳转至系官网。</span><strong><span>（建议提前联系意向导师交流沟通）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>材料审核及入选通知</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请截止后，交流营审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将以电子邮件形式通知。未通过审核者不作另外通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>交流营咨询方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>有关交流营活动咨询，请优先以“</span><strong><span>交流营咨询</span></strong><span>”为邮件主题发送给：</span><strong><span>meeyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></strong><span>或致电 </span><strong><span>0755-88018143</span></strong><span>（邓老师）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>南科大机械系研招QQ群：</span><strong><span>1092285570  (备注姓名+学校）</span></strong><span>。更多信息请关注南方科技大学机械与能源工程系网站：</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>https://mee.sustech.edu.cn/</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>欢迎扫码加入南科大机械系研招QQ群</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9SPiamOnOSibCjgsXibEiatcZEA29Ng8jwcT1Ftk5iazhbzxMMxbUXmx10Tq5SocUJUZJpKicuJibhpjE2obt7vOc1u25eLnvJbDl5YCdpIY4tAf4E/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>南科大机能系简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibAUialYMN2ShSf0uWFtd8hPeMerGzkMibpg6Ic4GqEneL5qAvhNUcTtXVLnPSoN9ibfRUpBaHwMGnLdNyuZvpECMHOlDo9L96TKxs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>南方科技大学机械与能源工程系建立于2016年1月，以建设国际一流的创新工程人才培养和科学研究基地为目的。建系以来，大力引进海内外高层次人才，已初步建成一支优秀的教学与科研团队，现有教研序列教授36人，其中包括：3名全职院士、22名国家高层次人才入选者（含青年）。本学科研究生导师全部具有博士学位，教研系列教授 94% 以上人才有海外教育及工作经历，63% 以上来自于哈佛大学、麻省理工大学、斯坦福大学、剑桥大学、英国伦敦国王学院、瑞士苏黎世联邦理工学院、日本东京大学、香港大学等世界大学排名前 50 的知名高校。</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>先进的科研平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9SPiamOnOSibDicZtJhQWLu5ViasEo6aYXwzXcGPsIJVThA1EXc1Ut0ytqQerULPdNTo3icDtu93cl4iaAfT2K16gwGXic0MMv5JgIYYKC9gk8Ag08/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>成立10年以来，机械与能源工程系已获批建设4个广东省高校重点实验室、4个市级重点实验室、1个深圳市工程实验室、2个深圳市工程研究中心、2个广创团队、4个孔雀团队，成立了以赵天寿院士牵头的南科大碳中和能源研究院、以戴建生院士牵头的南科大机器人研究院。现已建成近40个科研实验室，签订27个校企联合实验室，与华为、腾讯、富士康等知名企业进行科研合作。未来将建设成为兼具创新人才培养模式、前沿交叉、国际化的一流科研平台。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>前沿的研究方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibB8iaiaViajwkPWX5kNehPY1I4NAzBZzyVjzxLmHibGO8tSDJ7QOFPfFoXsRMCpR2su0YVicHnGiagcCLYpiazD96nx6Ruhg8DbnWNcZk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibDbDWauxB9hJgibk9VyYSoWvYgM0XJ6cOPEsuESdvzv3ibNDHblk8lvBl7wFCicqbaTLibVIHeQMSAxf8ymX7DREVCY6S8cWF5iafBM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibBUv3gOPrVEdSibhj4Vo6AEh6JAxshPox1wYa5nfVib0s9eibpZ1tnMT0BWQPmSFibt5LvBuOfzjqxiazattyokiacCvBG3Jo8HMEOgY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibBl6rWvPCRN5GkhrWh0sbgbzNVgib97JVNicgiaL5iaQEia6tpxhxWDW2EYQxPuWiaib9zQaPeZpwes5kkUhwVq4g8noaZqX7ibic1whMpg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>本系的科学研究及学生培养以机器人技术、先进制造、新能源科学与技术为核心，发展机器人技术、智能制造、成形制造及3D&amp;4D打印、精密超精密加工、软物质设计与制造、激光微纳制造、新能源工程等前沿交叉学科。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>创新型培育模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibDlNTHSk9xxu370ibbNzaeHJRbXiaGf6NmA7JUTtWd45UBNlhgN6rRphxT12f5TxsickldBA2NwiaHgFtSfVof6WOy72laXCLSaOp0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>在卓越师资的引领下，同学们潜心科研，参加国内外前沿会议，独立或组团承担创新实践项目，取得多项优质成果。南科大给予学生丰厚的奖助学金、先进的科研设备及平台、良好的英文学习环境，助力学生成为具有坚实理论基础、杰出实践能力、自主学习能力的创新拔尖人才。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>多元化成果输出</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibAeGaZ4Lh7Eeiaks2ysIDOEM8iclRAoSX7Wqv4eIiaTSibWPCsUoLuVj6bloh4lR6oRvO3vjHrIchg8jO0yFF7rUh8deUWar7sOWZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>近年来，本系研究生斩获“挑战杯”国家级银奖3项、铜奖2项、省级金奖4项，获水下机器人、软体机器人、机器人及人工智能等国内国际级竞赛奖励80余项。研究生以一作发表SCI高水平论文500余篇，其中在Science Advances、Nature Communications、International Journal of Machine Tools and Manufacturing、Advanced Materials等顶级期刊上发表研究论文20余篇，受邀参加国内外会议报告研究成果逾300人次。本系已有硕博毕业生合计逾380人。硕士升学读博率约为25%，就职于华为、大疆、比亚迪、鹏芯微等龙头企业的毕业生约15%。前景无限广阔！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><strong><span>期待各位优秀学子相聚南科大</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>在交流中碰撞思想</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>在探索中收获成长</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>愿本次交流营成为大家逐梦科研、启航未来的新起点</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>机械能源系诚邀全国优秀学子共探前沿、共筑未来！！</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>机械与能源工程系</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑| 李新月</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9SPiamOnOSibDKX3iaSoUe4MusWLNtI8yJ2NwRmocicLlyI3QQGsxXIXDkLMpzyibcZn1dZkpmC6icCbCMAqWWclas7m6zF9Jo6ufNWBuOk3TtQWA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"26466233989af9e45ddfbeaf3af1deb057406495eea02c2ec23360de5f57428b","textLength":2395,"sourceSha256":"90345d715a9b000fdb7049853e231bb5fe1cb3fb35f1ba8c4afaae5de686bd4b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-861f767c9724c5e9adae","title":"2026年南方科技大学机械与能源工程系2026年全国优秀大学生夏季交流营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:16.597037+00:00"}
